Changelog: 20-10-2026 22:51:30

Added. Sys info, a fifth pill in the header (owner, 20-10-2026): a small window with what the system reports about
the board, the BIOS (with UEFI and Secure Boot), the CPU, each GPU (with its PCIe link), the memory, the drives, the
