Changelog: 20-10-2026 21:16:14

Added. The wallpaper's transparency (owner, 20-10-2026): a slider in the Wallpaper pill's menu sets how much of the
theme's colour lies over the picture, from 0 to 90 % in steps of 5, and the window changes while it moves. A dark or
busy picture can take more, so the icons on it stand out. It starts at 60 %, the veil until now, and is kept in the
portal's settings (portal/wallpaper_transparency); the pill's tooltip names it. Without a wallpaper the slider is off.
Tests: tests/test_window.py.

