Changelog: 19-10-2026 01:16:07

Release 2.1.1.

Changelog: 19-10-2026 00:00:41

Added. A tab per category: Sustainable, Graphics, Gaming, Utilities and Development, the categories of the apps'
icons, in place of the three folding sections. Each tab says at its top what its apps are for, and the portal opens
on the tab used last. Bazzite Test stays at the top, above the tabs, beside a notice of updates: it counts the
updates and reinstalls and names each app with its tab and versions, with a link that opens the app's tab at its
tile. A tab with an app to update or reinstall shows their number in red after its name. The notice takes the place
of the count in the header. apps.toml gives every app a category (the same as its icon's in icons/categories.toml),
which replaces development and section; the parser still reads a manifest without categories, for the manifests
of earlier portal releases.

